    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Hamachi the Psychotic Killer</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/21d3914019014dee1d5e3a43a3c40054.avif?t=1754865988\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/85207609fcf0f90e1f1b5768cd3bd55b.avif?t=1754865988\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamachi the Psychotic Killer is a Platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY, and under demonic influence, your goal is to kill everything in your path.. If you want to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.poster.avif?t=1754865988\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.webm?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.mp4?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter innocent civilians and paint the town red with Hamachi's weapon of choice: the axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.poster.avif?t=1754865988\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.webm?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.mp4?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally, you\u2019ll come across a chainsaw that grants invincibility and kills anything you touch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.poster.avif?t=1754865988\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.webm?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.mp4?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With blood fresh on your hands you're now wanted by the police. Run away, or they will catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.poster.avif?t=1754865988\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.webm?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.mp4?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current iteration of  early access  offers  3 playable worlds, and two Challenge Levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/3764e5a543525d643581dff8847fecbf.avif?t=1754865988\" width=2048 height=1280 /></span>Challenge Levels are short, tougher stages that reward a Steam Achievement upon completion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing, sparing or remaining neutral leads to one of the three main endings of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three distinct routes: Pacifist, Neutral, or Genocide, plus a hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique, demonic bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-original, vibrant pixel art paired with an energetic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups that enhance your abilities and make taking down enemies a breeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium Sushi delivered by Penelope to keep Hamachi at peak performance.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a cat level. i forgot where it is, but avoid it at all costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with love by mostly one person.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Hamachi the Psychotic Killer</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/21d3914019014dee1d5e3a43a3c40054.avif?t=1754865988\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/85207609fcf0f90e1f1b5768cd3bd55b.avif?t=1754865988\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamachi the Psychotic Killer is a Platformer game where you can play as the BAD GUY, and under demonic influence, your goal is to kill everything in your path.. If you want to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.poster.avif?t=1754865988\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.webm?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/b3850cf25b9f9685c94293cfc0ebff39.mp4?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slaughter innocent civilians and paint the town red with Hamachi's weapon of choice: the axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.poster.avif?t=1754865988\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.webm?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/76014fe74e54db21d57c6e712f98a70f.mp4?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally, you\u2019ll come across a chainsaw that grants invincibility and kills anything you touch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.poster.avif?t=1754865988\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.webm?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/f1fffabbb45dddb462ea1679e4249809.mp4?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With blood fresh on your hands you're now wanted by the police. Run away, or they will catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.poster.avif?t=1754865988\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.webm?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/13ad4466a37ca4ce1ffd90968b1914b0.mp4?t=1754865988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current iteration of  early access  offers  3 playable worlds, and two Challenge Levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355690/extras/3764e5a543525d643581dff8847fecbf.avif?t=1754865988\" width=2048 height=1280 /></span>Challenge Levels are short, tougher stages that reward a Steam Achievement upon completion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing, sparing or remaining neutral leads to one of the three main endings of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three distinct routes: Pacifist, Neutral, or Genocide, plus a hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique, demonic bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-original, vibrant pixel art paired with an energetic soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups that enhance your abilities and make taking down enemies a breeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium Sushi delivered by Penelope to keep Hamachi at peak performance.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a cat level. i forgot where it is, but avoid it at all costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with love by mostly one person.</p></li></ul>",
